    {
      "source": "since 3.3, use <a href=\"#getId()\"><code>getId()</code></a> instead as the cursorId can exceed <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Long.html#MAX_VALUE\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Long.MAX_VALUE</code></a>.",
      "translation": "自 3.3 版本起，请使用 <a href=\"#getId()\"><code>getId()</code></a> 替代 cursorId，因为 cursorId 的值可能超过 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Long.html#MAX_VALUE\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Long.MAX_VALUE</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the reference cursor.",
      "translation": "返回引用游标。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Using a Java 8 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/util/CloseableIterator.html#stream()\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.util\"><code>java.util.stream.Stream</code></a> allows to apply additional\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/stream/Stream.html#filter(java.util.function.Predicate)\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.stream\"><code>filters</code></a> and\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/stream/Stream.html#limit(long)\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.stream\"><code>limits</code></a> to the underlying <a href=\"Cursor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.core\"><code>Cursor</code></a>.",
      "translation": "使用 Java 8 的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/util/CloseableIterator.html#stream()\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.util\"><code>java.util.stream.Stream</code></a>，可以对底层的 <a href=\"Cursor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.core\"><code>Cursor</code></a> 应用额外的\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/stream/Stream.html#filter(java.util.function.Predicate)\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.stream\"><code>filters</code></a> 和\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/stream/Stream.html#limit(long)\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.stream\"><code>limits</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
