      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Make sure to <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/util/CloseableIterator.html#close()\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.util\"><code>close</code></a> the cursor when done as this allows implementations to clean up\nany resources they need to keep open to iterate over elements (eg. by using a try-with-resource statement).",
      "translation": "完成时请确保 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/util/CloseableIterator.html#close()\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.util\"><code>close</code></a> 游标，以便实现类能够清理其用于遍历元素所需保持打开的任何资源（例如，通过使用 try-with-resources 语句）。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
